# Trivy misconfiguration suppressions for this repo (intentional, documented).

# AVD-DS-0002: the worker-bridge base runs as root; the runtime user is set by
# the agent's worker pod securityContext, not by a USER directive here.
AVD-DS-0002

# AVD-AZU-0019 / AVD-AZU-0020 (PostgreSQL log_checkpoints / log_connections):
# server parameters tuned for auditing are a v2 concern; the platform's own
# logging integration is the intended path.
AVD-AZU-0019
AVD-AZU-0020

# AVD-AZU-0021 (connection_throttling): same as above.
AVD-AZU-0021

# AVD-AZU-0017 / public network access: the server is created with a public
# endpoint on purpose, reachable only from the addresses in allowed_ips
# (the cluster's egress IP). Private access needs a VNet-delegated subnet the
# caller's network layer has to own, which is out of scope for this version.
# TLS is enforced (require_secure_transport = on). See "The server is
# reachable from the public internet" in the README.
AVD-AZU-0017
AVD-AZU-0018
